iller", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard05-of-06\\turns\\005f3d4764ea34d450ec1bec.wav"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Got it. Were there any other unfamiliar amounts on your statement?", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard05-of-06\\turns\\b9da2fd0ce92872a40db10e9.wav", "action_label": null, "response_style_label": null}, {"role": "user", "text": "No, just that single one.", "kind": "filler", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard05-of-06\\turns\\8aac3edf120b4fe112575459.wav"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Okay, no problem. Does the number ending in six-one-eight still work for you?", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard05-of-06\\turns\\e95a5f34ebe39daadeabb8c1.wav", "action_label": null, "response_style_label": null}, {"role": "user", "text": "Yes, that number is current.", "kind": "filler", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard05-of-06\\turns\\e4184e49817e7613bc2052b8.wav"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Understood. One last thing – have you ever shared this number with any services that charge you on a regular basis?", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard05-of-06\\turns\\1f1078128d1e184c5b75b299.wav", "action_label": null, "response_style_label": null}, {"role": "user", "text": "Only my usual streaming subscription.", "kind": "filler", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard05-of-06\\turns\\433e1275fd155ff4de8ef399.wav"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "No problem. Has your card been out of your possession recently, or has any information on the card changed?", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard05-of-06\\turns\\64c97f34b9bbe123a94677dc.wav", "action_label": null, "response_style_label": null}, {"role": "user", "text": "Worth mentioning: my card was reissued a few weeks ago after a skimming alert.", "kind": "clue", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard05-of-06\\turns\\ce78df2a9109e7